# Lamlet-authored free-particle reconstruction of a velocity-unit mechanism.
# It does not reproduce the source's potential, crystal, or irradiation model.
units metal
atom_style atomic
lattice sc {lattice_spacing}
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units box
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 5 5 5 units box
mass 1 {mass}
pair_style zero 1.0
pair_coeff * *
velocity all set {velocity} 0 0 {units_option}
compute measured all ke
thermo_style custom step c_measured
thermo_modify format float %.17g
run 0
